# Generated output. These are published to the orphan `gh-pages` branch, which carries one
# commit and is force-pushed by the daily job; `main` keeps only hand-written source.
#
# Committing them to `main` as well put ~34 MB of new blobs in history every weekday: the
# inline chart SVGs differ byte-for-byte on every re-render even when the numbers are
# identical. The site is 38 MB on disk and the repository had reached 55 MB in three days.
# Nothing is lost - each page records the snapshot hash and git commit it came from.
/t/
/report.html
/glance.html
/data/
